<section class="block" id="g-domains" aria-labelledby="g-dom-h"><h2 id="g-dom-h">The four domains</h2><p class="lede">Axiomatic Design, from Nam P. Suh, maps each domain to the next. Each record on the right answers a record on the left. The team splits each FR into child FRs only after it chooses the DP for that FR. This back-and-forth is the zigzag.</p><svg class="domains" viewBox="0 0 880 250" role="img" aria-labelledby="dom-t"><title id="dom-t">The four domains of Axiomatic Design and the zigzag between FRs and DPs</title>
<defs><marker id="ar" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="9" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto"><path d="M0 0L10 5L0 10z" fill="#5E5D59"/></marker></defs>
<g font-family="system-ui,sans-serif" font-size="14" fill="#141413">
<rect x="0" y="10" width="190" height="70" fill="#FAF9F6" stroke="#141413"/><text x="14" y="36" font-size="11" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" fill="#5E5D59">CUSTOMER DOMAIN</text><text x="14" y="62" font-weight="600">Needs</text>
<rect x="230" y="10" width="190" height="70" fill="#FAF9F6" stroke="#141413"/><text x="244" y="36" font-size="11" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" fill="#5E5D59">FUNCTIONAL DOMAIN</text><text x="244" y="62" font-weight="600">FRs: what it must do</text>
<rect x="460" y="10" width="190" height="70" fill="#FAF9F6" stroke="#141413"/><text x="474" y="36" font-size="11" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" fill="#5E5D59">PHYSICAL DOMAIN</text><text x="474" y="62" font-weight="600">DPs: how it does it</text>
<rect x="690" y="10" width="190" height="70" fill="#FAF9F6" stroke="#141413"/><text x="704" y="36" font-size="11" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" fill="#5E5D59">PROCESS DOMAIN</text><text x="704" y="62" font-weight="600">PVs and modules</text>
<path d="M190 45H228" stroke="#5E5D59" marker-end="url(#ar)"/><path d="M420 45H458" stroke="#5E5D59" marker-end="url(#ar)"/><path d="M650 45H688" stroke="#5E5D59" marker-end="url(#ar)"/>
<text x="244" y="110" font-size="11" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" fill="#5E5D59">ZIGZAG DECOMPOSITION</text>
<rect x="290" y="124" width="70" height="30" fill="#141413"/><text x="306" y="144" fill="#FAF9F6" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" font-size="12">FR1</text>
<rect x="520" y="124" width="70" height="30" fill="#141413"/><text x="536" y="144" fill="#FAF9F6" font-family="ui-monospace,monospace" font-size="12">DP1</text>
